35,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The data is clear. Projects succeed when access is shared. Older blocks are traps, adding months of delay.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"The timetable shows we paid for off-site space for two terms. Meanwhile, specialist rooms sit idle, yet general requests are rejected.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"The reserve is empty. We bought expensive gear, wrote it off, and forgot to fund its replacement. That’s a silent tax on future budgets.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Wow, the reserve is empty! We bought gear, wrote it off, and forgot to replace it. That’s a silent tax on our future budgets!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
